{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/a5bf3ae769a39c62a36003946b8c8596.avif?t=1773998750\" width=696 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Tourists </strong>is a<strong> multiplayer photo rail shooter. </strong>Take pictures of the curiosities along the different routes in the dungeons on each floor. <strong>Complete your collection</strong> while <strong>hanging out </strong>and<strong> chatting with your friends</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Agency invites you to its\u00a0touristic program</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated floors <strong>with up to 4 players</strong>. Each floor is a new story... with its own set of surprises to take photos of. <strong>Earn rewards with your new photos and unlock new floors!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/086f758b89fc4aeb918ce2ca1992dade.poster.avif?t=1773998750\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/086f758b89fc4aeb918ce2ca1992dade.webm?t=1773998750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/086f758b89fc4aeb918ce2ca1992dade.mp4?t=1773998750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a photo, get some lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig up each floor's lore by taking photos of new curiosities! <strong>All your discoveries will be added to your encyclopaedia during your adventure</strong>. And who knows... Maybe you will also unravel the secrets of the Agency: the curious establishment behind this touristic program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/1480346a83beb49ef6e1e64d8de7d7b1.avif?t=1773998750\" width=744 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim for the perfect picture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have your photos evaluated after each run</strong>. Earn the most points by taking <strong>the best possible photo of your subjects</strong>. And if that's not enough, push your luck a little. Throw things at them! Apparently, that's the only way to find some of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/741e7d1569b0f56d30b3029cbcf8e1f7.poster.avif?t=1773998750\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/741e7d1569b0f56d30b3029cbcf8e1f7.webm?t=1773998750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/741e7d1569b0f56d30b3029cbcf8e1f7.mp4?t=1773998750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/11082342c4e6d5dc64b1f2f6a9aae60d.gif?t=1773