ure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have your photos evaluated after each run</strong>. Earn the most points by taking <strong>the best possible photo of your subjects</strong>. And if that's not enough, push your luck a little. Throw things at them! Apparently, that's the only way to find some of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/741e7d1569b0f56d30b3029cbcf8e1f7.poster.avif?t=1773998750\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/741e7d1569b0f56d30b3029cbcf8e1f7.webm?t=1773998750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/741e7d1569b0f56d30b3029cbcf8e1f7.mp4?t=1773998750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/11082342c4e6d5dc64b1f2f6a9aae60d.gif?t=1773998750\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/extras/11082342c4e6d5dc64b1f2f6a9aae60d.poster.avif?t=1773998750\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bon voyage!</p>","developers":["KMLO"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930480/dc6ae087ab38993d77c2fff2c0b1c390a256b306/header.jpg?t=1773998750","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<stron